    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2021_0166","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Þóra Pereira talks about the moment before the first mark. The artist insists the recording itself is the artwork and that we are now co-authors.</Description>
